  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Fate sphere, Protection sphere (Punishment)</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use the Punishment succor, you may target the attacker with a word in place of dealing the damage from Punishment. The spell point cost of such a word is reduced by 1, to a minimum of 0. In addition, when using the Punishment succor, you may end a word or motif effect which you have spent at least one spell point on in place of ending an aegis.</p>\n<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Card Casting 2: Counters and Control</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/fate#toc113\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
